# ROADMAP Task 15 Phase B2b: CHANGELOG.md is copied into the app's assets at build time so the
# in-app "What's new" viewer can read it. The copy is a build artifact -- the root CHANGELOG.md
# stays the single source of truth, and ignoring the copy is what makes it impossible to commit a
# stale duplicate of it.
/app/src/main/assets/CHANGELOG.md

# Build-time copies of docs/sample-data/*.csv, used by the instrumented seeding test. Same reasoning
# as the changelog copy above: docs/sample-data stays the single source of truth.
/app/src/androidTest/assets/
